{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":16.08},{"sectionId":"build","start":16.64,"end":31.76},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":32.56,"end":43.2}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":2.64,"text":"行動函式接收狀態與指令，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":3,"end":4.64,"text":"再回傳下一個狀態。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":5.28,"end":7.28,"text":"修改前先複製字典，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":7.48,"end":9.76,"text":"可保留呼叫端先前的快照。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":10.4,"end":12.24,"text":"這讓前後比較更容易，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":12.6,"end":14.32,"text":"也能單獨測試行動，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":14.52,"end":16.08,"text":"不必重播整個故事。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":16.64,"end":18.24,"text":"在 /chapter3."},{"sectionId":"build","start":18.56,"end":22.88,"text":"py 把 return state 改為 return next_state。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":23.44,"end":26.8,"text":"第一個印出的物品狀態應仍為 False，"},{"sectionId":"build","start":26.88,"end":28.88,"text":"回傳的狀態則變為 True。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":29.54,"end":31.76,"text":"為什麼在這裡回傳新字典？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":32.56,"end":35.36,"text":"為什麼在這裡回傳新字典？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":36.56,"end":40.32,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":40.8,"end":43.2,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}